# Scoped to docker/launcher/Dockerfile; do not change other image build contexts.
# Real native-argv tests create non-UTF8 filenames and symlink loops in tmp/.
# They are execution evidence, never image inputs. Exclude before BuildKit walks
# them, and do not copy host-built target artifacts into the Bookworm builder.
**/.git
**/tmp
**/temp
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.cache
**/.conformance-tmp
**/coverage
**/*.log

# Never send runtime credentials or decrypted environment files to a builder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/env/dec
**/*.agekey
**/*.age-key
**/keys.txt
**/sops-private*.txt
